  "description": {"zh-CN": "8 床麻醉后恢复室（PACU，一期复苏），护士站居中可直视每张床：每床中心供氧/负压、监护仪（含呼气末二氧化碳）、输液泵与床间隔帘；配抢救车、除颤仪、呼吸机、困难气道车、床旁血气分析与保温设备。8 个手术间对应 8 个复苏床位（常用规划比例约 1:1–1.5:1）。", "en": "8-bay post-anaesthesia care unit (Phase I recovery) with a central station in direct view of every bay: piped oxygen and suction, a monitor with capnography, an infusion pump and curtains at each bay; crash cart, defibrillator, ventilator, difficult airway trolley, point-of-care blood gas and warming. Eight bays for eight ORs (a common planning ratio is about 1–1.5 bays per OR)."},
